// title: Something happens at a place
// about: Something found while exploring, with a result to remember.
// kind: event
// order: 12
// question: name|Name|name|
// question: area|Exploring area|zone|
// question: repeat|How often|choice:once,until resolved,always|once
// question: opening|What happens?|prose|You discover something unexpected.
// question: item|An item to find (optional)|item?|
== event {{id}}
name: {{name}}
found by: exploring in {{area}}
repeat: {{repeat}}
outcomes: taken, left
play:
    {{opening}}
    * Take it
        {{item_effect}}
        ~ outcome taken
        ~ resolve
        -> end
    * Leave it
        ~ outcome left
        -> end
